    "html_url": "https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/2a59f08f794e613d21c89f52a236bb5628ab3bcd",
    "message": "Add Painter images and native appearance styling to AdaptiveNavigationBar on iOS\n\nUIKitImage.Painter draws any Compose Painter (painterResource,\nrememberVectorPainter, image loaders) offscreen at the screen density, so\neven-odd fills, strokes, transforms and bitmaps survive, and lets the caller\npick the UIKit rendering mode (template vs original). UIKitImage.Bitmap gains\nscale and rendering mode. ImageBitmap -> UIImage now goes through PNG\nencoding, which keeps premultiplied alpha and channel order correct for\ncolored content.\n\nUIKitTabBarConfiguration gains per-state icon/title colors, a title font\n(UIKitFont.System / UIKitFont.Named) and a background color, applied through\nUITabBarAppearance. TabBarManager updates native items in place when only\ntheir content changed, so an asynchronously loaded image does not rebuild\nthe tab bar.",
